# DISABLED: Codex is not part of this project.
# Running Codex and Claude Code in one repo/container is not officially supported
# (no official guidance or shared control setup found), and Codex's bubblewrap sandbox
# needs a loosened container. Not pursued here. If the Codex sandbox is needed, build it
# in a fork of this project that references this repo, so the Claude setup is untouched.
# Kept commented out for reference only.

# Codex command rules: git read-only, no gh.
# Source: learn.chatgpt.com/docs/agent-configuration/rules.md
# No negation syntax: write/network git subcommands are listed explicitly.
# Exact-prefix matching: global options before the subcommand are denied below.
# Not covered by prefix rules: --opt=value tokens, absolute paths,
# and scripts Codex does not split (redirection, env vars, wildcards).

